 bg-roots-beige p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><p class=\"text-roots-text font-light text-sm mb-4\">Sunita&#x27;s Rise as an Entrepreneur</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-1 cursor-pointer text-roots-skilled\">Read Case Study</span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-roots-skilled\">›</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\" py-16 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-regular text-[var(--roots-text)] mb-8\">Engineering real change, rooted in measurable impact.</h2><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-8\"><button style=\"border-color:var(--roots-agriculture);background-color:var(--roots-agriculture);color:#f8f2eb\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-regular transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Agriculture and Environment</button><button style=\"border-color:#d1d5db;background-color:#f8f2eb;color:#374151\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-regular transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Sports and Physical Literacy</button><button style=\"border-color:#d1d5db;background-color:#f8f2eb;color:#374151\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-regular transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Education and Career Readiness</button><button style=\"border-color:#d1d5db;background-color:#f8f2eb;color:#374151\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-regular transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Skill and Community Development</button></div><div style=\"border-color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"w-full border-2 rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 bg-[var(--roots-beige)] transition-colors duration-500 text-left\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between h-full\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6 transition-colors duration-500\">Agriculture and Environment</h3><div><p style=\"color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-1 transition-colors duration-500\">10,00,000 +</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-[var(--roots-text)]\">Farmers trained in good practices</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-[var(--roots-text)] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">We work with farmers and rural communities to design and implement sustainable agricultural practices that address local challenges. Our initiatives focus on improving productivity, managing natural resources, and supporting climate aware solutions that ensure long term resilience.</p><div class=\"relative w-full h-[130px] sm:h-[150px] md:h-[170px] rounded-md overflow-hidden mb-3\"><img alt=\"Agriculture and Environment\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><a style=\"color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold hover:underline transition-colors duration-500 w-fit\" href=\"/impact/agriculture\">Read More <span>›</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#09569A] py-10 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\" text-white text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-regular  mb-12\">Partner with us to co-create measurable impact</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 px-10\"><div class=\"relative flex h-full min-h-[320px] flex-col overflow-hidden bg-white\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-roots-primary text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\">The Catalyst / Fulcrum</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-roots-text\">Leverage All Stakeholders</p><p class=\"mt-5 flex-1 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-roots-text\">Collaboration is key — we bring together all stakeholders to drive your tailor-made initiative for a lasting impact.</p><a class=\"mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center py-3 bg-roots-primary text-white border-2 border-roots-primary text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white hover:text-roots-primary transition-all duration-300\" href=\"/partner\">Partner With Us</a></div></div><div class=\"relative flex h-full min-h-[320px] flex-col overflow-hidden bg-white\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-roots-primary text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\">The Launchpad</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-roots-text\">Insights to Impact</p><p class=\"mt-5 flex-1 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-roots-text\">Enter ready live projects initiatives designed with a strategic backbone and seamless execution.</p><a class=\"mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center py-3 bg-roots-primary text-white border-2 border-roots-primary text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white hover:text-roots-primary transition-all duration-300\" href=\"/partner\">Partner With Us</a></div></div><div class=\"relative flex h-full min-h-[320px] flex-col overflow-hidden bg-white\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-roots-primary text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\">The Anchor</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-roots-text\">Own the Project (Multiplier Effect)</p><p class=\"mt-5 flex-1 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-roots-text\">Enter ready live projects initiatives designed with a strategic backbone and seamless execution.</p><a class=\"mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center py-3 bg-roots-primary text-white border-2 border-roots-primary text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white hover:text-roots-primary transition-all duration-300\" href=\"/partner\">Partner With Us</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-10 overflow-hidden mt-10\"><style>\n        @keyframes scroll-left {\n          0% { transform: translateX(0); }\n          100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }\n        }\n        @keyframes scroll-right {\n          0% { transform: translateX(-50%); }\n          100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n        }\n        \n        /* Speed matching */\n        .animate-scroll-left {\n          animation: scroll-left 27.5s linear infinite;\n        }\n        .animate-scroll-right {\n          animation: scroll-right 25s linear infinite;\n        }\n      </style><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto mb-8 px-6 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-regular text-roots-text\">Partnerships</h2></div><div class=\"w-full bg-[#FAF1EC] py-10 flex flex-col gap-10\"><div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden relative flex items-center\"><div class=\"flex whitespace-nowrap min-w-max items-center gap-16 animate-scroll-left hover:[animation-play-state:paused]\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-[160px] h-[80px] relative\"><img src=\"/companylogo